<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Plan Your Mudroom Around These Measurements</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Before you pick furniture, measure the wall and the path to the door. These common sizes keep a mudroom comfortable to use and easy to walk through.</p>



